INSTALLATION:
-------------

1. Copy "ipanel-center/" directory into "widgets/hotels/" in your current installation of uHotelBooking script.
2. Go to Hotels Management > Settings > Integration page and check if you see Center Panel textarea with generated code.

That's all!


To start testing this widget do following:

1. Go to Hotels Management > Settings > Integration page.
2. Copy code generated in "Center Panel" section.
3. Create test.html file and paste the code coied on previous step into this file, save it. 
4. Run test.html file by opening it in web browser.
5. Follow instructions to make test reservation.
